    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "maybe walking away is all i can do. but i don't mean just leaving the throne or the battle. i mean leaving everything behind. i feel like i'm just dragging this shell of a person through a world that doesn't want me anymore. if i were just... gone... would the world even notice a difference? or would it just be quieter? easier?",
